<section
    id="about"
    class="py-16 md:py-24 px-6 md:px-12 bg-white overflow-hidden border-t-8 border-gray-100 relative"
>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="w-full flex justify-end mb-6 md:mb-8">
            <p
                class="font-oswald text-2xl sm:text-4xl opacity-40 leading-none text-blue-600"
                aria-hidden="true"
            >
                02 ↗
            </p>
        </div>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center gap-8 lg:gap-16"
        >
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <h3
                        class="text-blue-500 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs md:text-sm mb-2"
                    >
                        星街すいせい — Hi... World~
                    </h3>
                    <h2
                        class="font-oswald text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl text-blue-600 leading-none tracking-tighter mb-6"
                    >
                        BACKEND<br />ENGINEER.
                    </h2>
                    <div
                        class="flex gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs uppercase text-blue-800 font-bold mb-8 flex-wrap"
                    >
                        <span
                            class="border border-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
                            >Universitas Widyatama</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="border border-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
                            >Teknik Informatika</span
                        >
                        <span
                            class="border border-blue-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
                            >Open Source</span
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-4 md:space-y-6 text-gray-700 relative z-10"
            >
                <p
                    class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed"
                >
                    Halo, saya <strong class="text-blue-600 font-semibold"
                        >Dimas Dwi Ariyanto</strong
                    >. Saat ini saya adalah mahasiswa Teknik Informatika di
                    Universitas Widyatama dan seorang penggiat
                    <i>Open Source</i> yang berdedikasi.
                </p>
                <p
                    class="text-sm md:text-md font-light leading-relaxed opacity-80"
                >
                    Saya sangat tertarik dengan pemrograman tingkat sistem,
                    optimalisasi kernel, dan pengembangan backend latensi
                    rendah. Bagi saya, kode bukan sekadar instruksi, melainkan
                    seni arsitektur digital.
                </p>
                <div
                    class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 md:p-6 mt-6 md:mt-8"
                >
                    <p
                        class="font-mono text-xs md:text-sm text-blue-900 leading-relaxed"
                    >
                        "I hated going to meetings, but missing one hour was
                        enough to make my code base disappear from my mind."
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
